# Contrôle du plan (10 règles sur 12 passées)

27 composants, 33 faces, 62 coins, 60 interfaces entre composants, 20 bords ouverts dont 20 déclarés.
Preuve des coins : 24 par deux vues, 22 par une vue et une règle, 6 par une vue et un nombre, 10 par nombres seuls.

| Règle | Ce qui est contrôlé | Résultat | Trouvé | Limite |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| P1 | every face of the plan is solved in 3D | PASSE | 0 | 0 |
| P2 | every component is on exactly one sheet (assembly) | PASSE | 0 | 0 |
| P3 | declared corners turn (under 155 deg) | PASSE | 0 | 0 |
| P4 | side points do not turn (over 140 deg) | PASSE | 0 | 0 |
| P5 | no edge shorter than 10 mm | PASSE | 0 | 0 |
| P6 | no edge shared by three faces | PASSE | 0 | 0 |
| P7 | every open border is declared (an opening the design wants) | PASSE | 0 | 0 undeclared of 20 borders |
| P8 | a centre panel has one edge on the symmetry plane | PASSE | 0 | 0 |
| P9 | overall size of the panels against the specification | ÉCHEC | 1 | within 40 mm |
|  | width_mm: plan 2220, specification 2268 |  |  |  |
| P10 | faces declared flat are flat (3 mm) | PASSE | 0 | 0 |
| P11 | every traced edge is one fair line close to the views | ÉCHEC | 5 | zigzag <= 5 deg, <= 20 mm off the trace |
|  | rl_bc|rl_bl: 56 mm off its trace, 6 degrees of zigzag (add a corner or redraw) |  |  |  |
|  | hood_f|hood_r: 46 mm off its trace, 0 degrees of zigzag (add a corner or redraw) |  |  |  |
|  | crm|hood_f: 31 mm off its trace, 0 degrees of zigzag (add a corner or redraw) |  |  |  |
|  | bp_b|g_rtip: 29 mm off its trace, 0 degrees of zigzag (add a corner or redraw) |  |  |  |
|  | door_tr|rf_top: 28 mm off its trace, 0 degrees of zigzag (add a corner or redraw) |  |  |  |
| P12 | every real-world element has a unique designator, a sheet and named points | PASSE | 0 | 0 |
